# CHIME CIRCUIT: track 8 can be finished. The demo pilot flies player one's
# ship with real button presses (steer, thrust, slash) for all eight laps,
# against the five CPU pilots, who race too.
seed 18
game chime
wait 30
cheat race 8
expect track == 7
expect map_ok == 1
botuntil fin0 == 1 30000
expect laps0 == 8
expect place0 >= 1
expect cpu_laps >= 8
